  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZKhuCdv.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"159\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:16px\">這是一款以古埃及為背景的探索地圖，包含各種金字塔、神廟、裝潢精美的房屋等！<br></span><br></span><em><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">無法進行生存模式遊戲！</span></em><br><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:16px\">- 沒有洞穴和礦石！</span><br><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:16px\">- 自訂世界外沒有原始地形！</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MSpnCu3.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\"><br></span></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">當夕陽低垂於地平線上，金字塔巍然屹立，永恆不變，<br>它們的影子在沙漠沙地上延伸。</span></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CbV6C0s.jpeg\" width=\"600\" height=\"371\"><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/tryzzmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">在 Patreon 上支持我！</span></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/tryzzmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🔥</a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xUmC7G4.jpeg\" width=\"700\" height=\"360\"><br><br></span></div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">使用條款：</span><br></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我的免費地圖始終可用於商業用途，只要您附上此頁面的連結即可。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
